Package: cigamingos-server
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: CiGaming <admin@snugglesmp.com>
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Depends: cigamingos-branding (= @VERSION@), cigamingos-tools (= @VERSION@),
 openssh-server, sudo, ufw, fail2ban, unattended-upgrades, apt-listchanges,
 caddy, postgresql, nodejs, npm, git, build-essential,
 curl, wget, rsync, htop, tmux, vim, jq, unzip, ca-certificates, chrony,
 logrotate, needrestart
Recommends: fastfetch, btop, ncdu, open-vm-tools, qemu-guest-agent
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: CiGaming OS server (fleet edition)
 A headless CiGaming OS for running the streamer-site and bot fleet:
 Node.js + npm (PM2 is installed globally by the image), PostgreSQL,
 Caddy for automatic HTTPS, SSH, a firewall and automatic security
 updates. No Docker, on purpose.
